<title>HONG KONG: Bank of China FRN seen launching next week.</title>
<headline>Bank of China FRN seen launching next week.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A floating rate note issue for the Bank of China is likely to be launched next week, lead manager Morgan Stanley International said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue will be US$200-300 million in size and have a maturity of five or seven years.</p>
<p>Roadshows have been held in Hong Kong and Singapore and will be staged in London.</p>
<p>The issue will be Bank of China's first foray into the international capital markets in more than two years.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
